msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(The Tojo is at a crossroads yet again. But I have someone\r\n"
"in mind to take over. Someone I trust to lead the clan back\r\n"
"down the right path.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"(Rest in peace, Kazama-san. You deserve that much.\r\n"
"And... thank you, for everything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"(Kazama-san... How could I repay you for everything you did\r\n"
"for me?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(Even though you were a ranking Tojo officer, you devoted\r\n"
"your life to Sunflower Orphanage and raised me and the\r\n"
"other kids like we were your own flesh and blood.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"(And when I got expelled from the clan and sentenced to\r\n"
"10 years in jail for the murder of Sohei Dojima... you were\r\n"
"one of the only people who didn't abandon me.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"(Then when I finally got out of prison, you used the Kazama\r\n"
"Family to protect me from all the Tojo men who were out for\r\n"
"my head.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "(You even laid down your life to save Haruka.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"(After your death, I took over as fourth chairman of the\r\n"
"Tojo Clan and managed to put a stop to the infighting.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"(But I wanted to wash my hands of the yakuza life... so I\r\n"
"installed Terada as the fifth chairman. Like me, he owed\r\n"
"you a massive debt.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"(That wasn't the end of my involvement, though, as I came\r\n"
"back into the fold to deal with the Jingweon Mafia's plot\r\n"
"for revenge.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"(You see, some Jingweon members you spared twenty years ago\r\n"
"wanted revenge on the Dojima Family for their downfall...\r\n"
"but I managed to thwart their plans.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"(And now, the Tojo is at a crossroads yet again. But I have\r\n"
"someone in mind to take over, someone I trust to lead the\r\n"
"clan back down the right path.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"(Rest in peace, Kazama-san. You deserve that much.\r\n"
"And... thank you, for everything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2668"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""